.DS_Store
.env
*.env
*.pem
*.key
*.log
# Public-capable repo: factory-internal artefacts live in wade-in-private and are
# never tracked here. Ignored as a backstop — scaffolding does not create them in this
# tree, so these entries should never match anything. If they start matching, something
# reintroduced the leak this split exists to prevent.
mind-palace/
.control-tower/
.hekton/agent-run-log.yaml
.hekton/change-log.yaml
.hekton/build-tasks/
docs/walkthroughs/
docs/session-log.md
docs/human-understanding-check.md
docs/depth-decision.md
docs/local-assumptions.md
docs/blog-signals.md
docs/gremlin-radar.md
scripts/sync-mirror-to-vault.sh
# check-mirror-drift.sh and setup-hooks.sh deliberately NOT ignored here (deviation from
# the scaffold-project.sh template default, matching object-lesson's precedent, see
# docs/decisions.md 2026-09-14): the scaffold script's own git-init step only ever installs
# the pre-push hook from $REPO_DIR/scripts/, so leaving these two private-sibling-only
# would mean the hook never installs for any public-capable project. Both scripts are
# generic (no vault paths, no secrets) and are tracked here so the pre-push hook this repo
# relies on actually works. A cross-workshop scaffold-project.sh fix is tracked in
# docs/next-actions.md rather than patched ad hoc per repo.
scripts/verify-project.sh
__pycache__/
node_modules/
.venv/
dist/
build/
*.bak.*
.project-setup/
# Astro's generated content-collection cache (site/.astro/): regenerated on every
# build/dev/check, not source. Matches every prior workshop site's convention.
.astro/
